idth=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VAT</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">duty</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[境外采购自用物资] --&gt; B[确定HS编码与原产国]&#10;  B --&gt; C{是否享受贸易协定优惠?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[备齐原产地证明]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[适用最惠国税率]&#10;  D --&gt; F[计算完税价格=成交价+运保费]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{货值不超过150欧元?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[关税免征]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[按税率计关税]&#10;  H --&gt; J[&quot;计进口增值税=(完税价+关税)x税率&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; K{用途可抵扣?}&#10;  K --&gt;|是| L[进项抵扣, 成本仅含关税与费用]&#10;  K --&gt;|否| M[增值税计入物资成本]&#10;  L --&gt; N[&quot;入账到成本中心/项目&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt; N\">graph TD\n  A[境外采购自用物资] --&gt; B[确定HS编码与原产国]\n  B --&gt; C{是否享受贸易协定优惠?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[备齐原产地证明]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[适用最惠国税率]\n  D --&gt; F[计算完税价格=成交价+运保费]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{货值不超过150欧元?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[关税免征]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[按税率计关税]\n  H --&gt; J[\"计进口增值税=(完税价+关税)x税率\"]\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; K{用途可抵扣?}\n  K --&gt;|是| L[进项抵扣, 成本仅含关税与费用]\n  K --&gt;|否| M[增值税计入物资成本]\n  L --&gt; N[\"入账到成本中心/项目\"]\n  M --&gt; N</pre><h2 id=\"贸易术语决定了谁付税\">贸易术语决定了谁付税</h2><h3 id=\"dap-与-ddp-的实务差别\">DAP 与 DDP 的实务差别</h3><p>自用物资采购的另一处误判来自贸易术语。Incoterms 2020 的 11 条规则里，7 条适用任何运输方式（EXW、FCA、CPT、CIP、DPU、DAP、DDP），4 条仅适用海运和内河（FAS、FOB、CFR、CIF），其中海运四条不适合集装箱、空运与陆运（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Incoterms\">Incoterms</a>）。对自用物资最关键的差别在 DDP 与 DAP：<strong>DDP 由卖方在买方国家办理进口清关并缴纳关税与税，DAP 则由买方负责进口清关并缴纳全部关税与税</strong>。这不是措辞细节，它决定了谁承担进口增值税的现金流与抵扣权。采购方若在 DAP 下没有提前准备进口资质与税号，货到口岸会滞留，产生仓储与滞报成本。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>出口清关</th>\n<th>主运费</th>\n<th>进口清关与税</th>\n<th>自用物资适用性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>EXW</td>\n<td>买方</td>\n<td>买方</td>\n<td>买方</td>\n<td>不推荐（买方责任过大）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FCA</td>\n<td>卖方</td>\n<td>买方</td>\n<td>买方</td>\n<td>常见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DAP</td>\n<td>卖方</td>\n<td>卖方</td>\n<td><strong>买方</strong></td>\n<td>常见，需自备进口资质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DDP</td>\n<td>卖方</td>\n<td>卖方</td>\n<td><strong>卖方</strong></td>\n<td>便捷，但卖方成本已含税</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"完税成本的入账\">完税成本的入账</h2><p>自用物资的入账金额不是发票金额，而是<strong>完税后总成本</strong>（landed cost）。这一点在采购系统上的要求是：收货或入库时不仅要记录数量，还要能关联到清关单据，把关税、进口增值税（不可抵扣部分）、清关服务费并入该批物资的成本。对固定资产类物资（如仪器设备），这批成本还要参与资本化判断——是否达到资本化门槛、折旧年限如何定。对耗材类（如备件），则直接计入当期费用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 完税成本记录：一件自用物资的到岸成本构成&#10;CREATE TABLE landed_cost (&#10;  landed_id      BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  po_line_id     BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES po_line(po_line_id),&#10;  hs_code        CHAR(10) NOT NULL,&#10;  origin_country CHAR(2) NOT NULL,&#10;  customs_value  NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL,   -- 成交价 + 运保费&#10;  duty_amount    NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  vat_amount     NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  vat_deductible BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE,&#10;  broker_fee     NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  currency       CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  decl_no        VARCHAR(64),              -- 报关单号，用于事后核查&#10;  cleared_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  capitalized    BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 入账金额 = 完税价格 + 不可抵扣增值税相关部分 + 清关费&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW v_landed_total AS&#10;SELECT po_line_id,&#10;       customs_value + duty_amount&#10;       + CASE WHEN vat_deductible THEN 0 ELSE vat_amount END&#10;       + broker_fee AS total_book_cost&#10;FROM landed_cost;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 完税成本记录：一件自用物资的到岸成本构成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> landed_cost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  landed_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  po_line_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> po_line(po_line_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hs_code        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  origin_country </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  customs_value  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 成交价 + 运保费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  duty_amount    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  vat_amount     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  vat_deductible </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TRUE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  broker_fee     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decl_no        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 报关单号，用于事后核查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cleared_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  capitalized    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 入账金额 = 完税价格 + 不可抵扣增值税相关部分 + 清关费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> v_landed_total</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> po_line_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       customs_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> duty_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       +</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vat_deductible </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vat_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> broker_fee </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_book_cost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> landed_cost;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>decl_no</code> 是必须保留的字段：海关事后核查（通常追溯数年）时，企业需要证明申报的价格、归类与原产国，而这份证明的入口就是报关单号。没有它，核查时只能靠人工翻找邮件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归类与优惠原产地的责任分界\">归类与优惠原产地的责任分界</h3><p>HS 归类错误的后果是补税加罚款，因此归类责任必须明确。可行分工是：<strong>供应商提供技术规格与建议归类（对货物最了解），采购方对申报归类负责（申报主体是进口方），必要时申请海关预裁定</strong>。预裁定在多数税制下可申请且对海关有约束力，对高价值或反复进口的物资是值得投入的动作。若货物原产于与进口国有自贸协定的国家，凭有效的原产地证明可享受协定税率，这部分与 [优惠原产地证书] 类议题相邻，但本 hub 只讲到「采购方需在订单时就索取并留存原产地证明」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>自用物资跨境进口的成本由货物、关税、进口增值税、清关费用叠加而成，入账金额是完税后总成本而非发票金额；关税可按低值额度免除但进口增值税通常没有；IOSS 简化的是远程销售的增值税申报，企业内部自用进口走常规申报；贸易术语决定了谁承担进口清关与税费，DAP 与 DDP 的差别直接影响现金流与资质要求；HS 归类与优惠原产地的责任必须明确到人，报关单号必须留存以备核查。税费口径的统一是 <a href=\"cost-center-budget-control\">成本中心/项目预算与超额审批</a> 里多币种预算与汇率冻结的前提。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>入账金额是完税后总成本，不是发票金额</li>\n<li>关税可按低值额度免除，进口增值税通常没有；IOSS 只管远程销售</li>\n<li>DAP 与 DDP 的差别决定进口清关与税费由谁承担；报关单号必须留存</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自用物资采购的税费/进口处理（边界156/188）","id":"自用物资采购的税费-进口处理-边界156-188"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：进口自用物资的三项成本构成","id":"核心概念-进口自用物资的三项成本构成"},{"level":2,"text":"低值货物的特殊规则","id":"低值货物的特殊规则"},{"level":3,"text":"关税可免、增值税不免","id":"关税可免-增值税不免"},{"level":2,"text":"贸易术语决定了谁付税","id":"贸易术语决定了谁付税"},{"level":3,"text":"DAP 与 DDP 的实务差别","id":"dap-与-ddp-的实务差别"},{"level":2,"text":"完税成本的入账","id":"完税成本的入账"},{"level":3,"text":"归类与优惠原产地的责任分界","id":"归类与优惠原产地的责任分界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"成本中心/项目预算与超额审批","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mro-indirect-procurement/indirect-budget-settlement/cost-center-budget-control"},"next":{"title":"间接采购节省/合规率与品类 KPI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mro-indirect-procurement/indirect-budget-settlement/indirect-saving-compliance-kpi"}}